 "schema": "custom_values/1",
 "version": "1.1",
 "note": "The value vocabulary of the customisation contract (package web_os_live_player v5, 07 §3). A placeholder or a value key not listed here is an authoring error (engine/customize.py) and is ignored at run time. Adding a customisation = one row here + a slot in a spec. v29.0 (package alhasan_u1_videos v2, 06 §3): each row may declare its `type` (text - the old `string` is its alias -, colour, image, number, list, choice), `bilingual` (an English and an Arabic text), `setBy` (\"course\": only a course value set, courses/<id>/values.xml, may give it; absent = the host, as every v1.0 row), `aliases` (old names that still resolve), and for a list its `items` and `maxItems`, for a choice its `choices`. Every v1.0 row is unchanged.",
 "types": [
  "text",
  "colour",
  "image",
  "number",
  "list",
  "choice"
 ],
